# CentCompras core

## Project

Central warehouse + satellite branches. Offline-capable product catalogue MVP (Django 6.1, PostgreSQL, plain HTML/JS).

## What exists today

- `accounts` — custom User, email login
- `branches` — Branch, BranchMembership, active branch middleware
- `products` — catalogue, API, CLI, offline web UI
- `orders` — not built yet

## Non-negotiables

- PostgreSQL = source of truth; IndexedDB = read-only catalogue cache
- Products created via CLI only (`add_product`), not from phone/web
- Business logic in `services.py`; views/commands stay thin
- Branch permissions via `branches/permissions.py`
- Plain Django + plain JavaScript — no React/Vue
- Incremental phases — no large application dumps

